STRING 3461
// Items: I0Lw (WC2Orc11Zuljin7), Description (Description)
{
Gul'dan! Where were your forces when we were attacked?! While my warriors were being slaughtered, you cared only for da power of da elves! Where is your loyalty to the Horde?!
}

